Z||000004||Phil||04-04-2001||03:47 PM||||Oops. <BR>Just had another thought - Is the hose going from the rad cap to the overflow bottle cracked? A leak there would let air into the system as the water cools down.<p>[This message has been edited by Phil (edited 04-04-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||sqoach||04-04-2001||05:20 PM||||I don't think it's cracked. But I haven't checked really good. At first I thought it was the clamp not holding good. I replaced that and it didn't work. I'll check all my hoses and stuff better. I'm assuming there's an air leak into the system somewhere. That's the only thing that makes sense to me. Everyone in chat one night was telling me it was the radiator, clogged or something, but that doesn't explain why my car doesn't overheat after I burp the system.||||reg||1
